{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
knotify watches through inotify(2), which takes one watch for every
directory it watches: with --recursive, one per directory in the tree.
All inotify users of one user ID share the limit
vfs.inotify.max_user_watches, a third of kern.maxvnodes by default.
Keep it above the number of directories in the trees that user watches.
EOM
}
